  "contentHtml": "\n                      <div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">こんにちは。石塚瑶季です</span><span class=\"s2\">❕💎</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">12</span><span class=\"s1\">日ぶりですね</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/ishizuka.tamaki/2023-03-07/51563_0.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7459.jpeg\" id=\"B858E811-1448-4D2A-BF21-FCF9B34F1341\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 48px); margin-left: -24px;\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">長いようなあっという間なような、、</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">それでは</span></p><p class=\"p4\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\">#tamakiblog Let's go~</span><span class=\"s2\">❣️</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">私事ですが</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\">高校の卒業式を迎えます。</p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">入学式ができなかったり</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">行事もなくなり、</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">毎日学校へ行く事すら出来なかったり。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">ずっと野球一筋だった兄からは</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">高校最後の夏、部活禁止どころか</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">全国高校野球が中止になり</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">今までの当たり前が当たり前じゃなくなり</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">突如目標を失う事の残酷さや</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">そこから立ち上がる強さを感じました。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">そんな先の見えない不安なスタートから</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">始まった高校生活でしたが、今思い返すと</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">登下校の道で四季を感じたり</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">そんな何気ない毎日が青春だったなって。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">高</span><span class=\"s3\">3</span><span class=\"s1\">の秋からこの活動を始めて</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">少し今までとは違くなったものの</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">何も変わらず接してくれた</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">先生やクラスメイト、親友など</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">たくさんの素敵な方達に支えられて</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">行ける日は全部、</span><span class=\"s3\"><span dir=\"ltr\">1</span></span><span class=\"s1\"><span dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\">時</span></span>間でも</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">学校へ行く位、毎日楽しかったです。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p3\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 9px 0px 8px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s3\"><img src=\"/images/blogs/ishizuka.tamaki/2023-03-07/51563_1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_7476.jpeg\" id=\"E239B740-ACE6-402C-82E5-422407287325\" _mf_state=\"1\" title=\"null\" class=\"x-apple-edge-to-edge\" style=\"width: calc(100% + 48px); margin-left: -24px;\"></span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">ばいばい！高校生！</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p5\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s2\">✨🐧</span><span class=\"s1\">近況</span><span class=\"s2\">🐧✨</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">最近はメンバーとお出かけしたり、</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">家族とお寿司を食べに行きました</span><span class=\"s2\">🍣</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">段々と春らしい気候にもなってきましたね！</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">みなさん花粉大丈夫ですか</span><span class=\"s2\">❓🌸</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">送って下さったお手紙ね</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">毎日読み返しています。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">本当に力が湧くというか</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">ありがとうを何回言っても足りない位。</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">早く面と向かって</span></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal;\"><span class=\"s1\">話したいし会いたいしお礼言いたいな。</span></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"-webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 22px;\"><span class=\"s3\"></span><br></p><p 